INFO  2026-06-28 07:41:08,385 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:740 - redpanda.group_min_session_timeout_ms:6000ms	- The minimum allowed session timeout for registered consumers. Shorter timeouts result in quicker failure detection at the cost of more frequent consumer heartbeating, which can overwhelm broker resources.
