INFO  2026-06-28 07:41:08,385 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:740 - redpanda.iceberg_rest_catalog_aws_service_name:glue	- AWS service name for SigV4 signing when using aws_sigv4 authentication mode. Defaults to 'glue' for AWS Glue Data Catalog. Can be changed to support other AWS services that provide Iceberg REST catalog APIs.
INFO  2026-06-28 07:41:08,385 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:740 - redpanda.iceberg_rest_catalog_base_location:{nullopt}	- Base URI for the Iceberg REST catalog. If unset, the REST catalog server determines the location. Some REST catalogs, like AWS Glue, require the client to set this. After Iceberg is enabled, do not change this value.
